  "purpose": "Distinguish conflict handling (IGNORE vs REPLACE vs DO UPDATE), trigger presence, and channel scope (main changes vs main total_changes vs main+other total_changes) by using repeated puts, updates, deletes, a rolled-back transaction, and writes on the other connection. The sequences create cases where committed state cancels but channel counts differ, and where main-only versus combined counters diverge."
